  "description": {
    "en": "Wilson Natural Gut 17 is a premium natural gut string constructed from natural serosa fibers treated through a stabilizing process and finished with a protective coating. It delivers industry-leading comfort, feel, power and tension maintenance. The thinner 17 gauge (1.25 mm) enhances feel and control while preserving the signature elasticity and energy return that define natural gut.",

    "zh": "Wilson Natural Gut 17 是一款采用天然 Serosa（牛肠浆膜）纤维制成的高端天然肠线，经过稳定化处理并覆盖保护涂层。它拥有业内领先的舒适性、力量、手感以及保磅能力。相比 16 号径，17（1.25mm）提供更细腻的触球反馈、更好的控制与 Ball Pocketing，同时保持天然肠线标志性的高弹性和能量回馈。"
  },

